docs/termine/20260508 Termin 7/Phase5_UML_Detail/22_architektur_skizze_REV5_2026_05_11.md:432:### 7.2 NEU REV 5: 28 fehlende Saeule-B-Concept-Klassen aus 13_md §6+§7
docs/termine/20260508 Termin 7/Phase5_UML_Detail/phase5_uml_detail_REV5.drawio:15:        <mxCell id="legend" value="LEGENDE REV 5&#10;Hellblau = Engine-Schicht (Ebene 1)&#10;Hellgruen = Saeule A Suchalgorithmus (Ebene 2)&#10;Lila = Saeule B CacheEngine + Plattform-Modell (Ebene 3)&#10;Pfeile = Konsumiert / Optimiert via&#10;NEU REV 5: ISearchPageStructure + ISearchPageStructureInterpreter,&#10;28 fehlende Saeule-B-Concepts, ICacheStrategy als Permutationsdimension" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#F57F17;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="1100" width="900" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
docs/termine/20260508 Termin 7/Phase5_UML_Detail/phase5_uml_detail_REV5.drawio:125:        <mxCell id="sub" value="KEINE plattform-spezifischen Klassen + 28 fehlende Saeule-B-Concepts aus 13_md §6+§7 ergaenzt" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=2;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A237E;fontColor=#1A237E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="2320" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
docs/termine/20260508 Termin 7/Phase5_UML_Detail/phase5_uml_detail_REV5.drawio:130:        <mxCell id="neu1" value="NEU REV 5 - 28 fehlende Saeule-B-Concepts (Teil 1: Hardware + Memory)&#10;━━━━━━━&#10;1.  IRankSelectPrimitive       - popcount / Jacobson 2-Level / Poppy (P09/P10/P04)&#10;2.  IModelAcquisitionStrategy  - wie wird ILivePlatformModel gewonnen? (P05)&#10;3.  IVirtualMemoryStrategy     - DirectMapping / RewiredSharedPages / HugePages (P05 Rewiring)&#10;4.  IBranchPredictorModel      - Mispredict-Cost als Plattform-Kennzahl (P01/P13)&#10;5.  IBitManipulationFeatureGate - BMI2 PEXT/PDEP, AVX2, popcount + Fallback (P02 HOT)&#10;6.  IStorageMedium             - DRAM/NVRAM/SSD/HDD-Hierarchy (P10 SuRF, P22)&#10;7.  IPageCacheModel            - OS Page Cache + App Block Cache 2-stufig (P10 SuRF)&#10;8.  IConcurrencyProtocol       - eigene Saeule C, orthogonal A/B (P02/P03/P08/P29/P30)&#10;9.  IRebuildScheduler          - VACUUM-aehnliche Trigger (P05 START Self-Tuning)&#10;10. IRebuildCostModel          - Bauzeit O(N h^2) bei P04 CoCo&#10;11. IWorkloadModel             - Read-Only/Read-Mostly/Write-Heavy/Mixed/Skewed/Range-Heavy&#10;12. ICellProbeModel vs IWordProbeModel - 2 alternative Plattform-Modelle (P09 Jacobson)&#10;13. IPositionalCorrespondencePrefetch - Prefetch via Layout-Invarianten (P10 SuRF)&#10;14. ICacheConflictModel        - FullAssociative vs SetAssociative (P18)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFEBEE;strokeColor=#B71C1C;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="700" width="1100" height="380" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
docs/termine/20260508 Termin 7/Phase5_UML_Detail/phase5_uml_detail_REV5.drawio:131:        <mxCell id="neu2" value="NEU REV 5 - 28 fehlende Saeule-B-Concepts (Teil 2: ISA + Memory-Decorator + Encoding)&#10;━━━━━━━&#10;15. ITemporalCacheStrategy     - Instruction-Cache, P15 §7 (REV 2 ICachePage ist Daten-orientiert)&#10;16. IIntelligentDMA            - Configurator/AGU/DataFetcher/Crawler (P31 iDMA)&#10;17. IComputeOffload            - PE/iDMA/App-Core/FPGA (P31)&#10;18. IHardwareExtension Sub-Hierarchie - WAH/PLWAH/COMPAX, Hash-Lookup, MergeSort, RiscBaseISA, SSE/AVX/SGX/THUMB/NEON (P31 TUD Goldstandard)&#10;19. IMemoryDecorator (NFP)     - latency/throughput/transience/reliability/wearout/random-accessibility/cache-coherence (P33 VAMPIR)&#10;20. IHeterogeneousAllocator (V-malloc) - heterogene Memory-Auswahl (P33)&#10;21. IMigrationPolicy           - transparente Daten-Migration zwischen Memory-Ebenen (P33 Compensation)&#10;22. ICompileTimeNegotiator     - Multi-Query Compile-Time-Negotiation (P33)&#10;23. IPipelineScheduler         - Operation-Pipelines mit Memory-Awareness (P33)&#10;24. IAccessPatternStrategy     - sequential/strided/simd (P32 To-Stride)&#10;25. IPaddingStrategy           - 576-Byte-Padding fuer Cache-Set-Disalignment (P32)&#10;26. IInformationTheoreticLowerBound - Optimality-Marker fuer Encoding (P09)&#10;27. IPositionalAddressing      - Implicit Addressing via Position-in-Bitstring (P09)&#10;28. ITopologyEncoding          - LOUDS/DFUDS/BP/Pointer/BitArray (orthogonal zu IFanout)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E0F2F1;strokeColor=#00695C;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1220" y="700" width="1100" height="380" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
